# The full SC6 profile: MetalFX 2x, Retina off for SC6, Game Mode forced on,
# native fullscreen, and a BGR10A2 layer (needed for direct presentation).
# Use the game's borderless fullscreen mode. The Metal HUD should say "Direct".
# Set DXMT_DUMP_LAYERS=1 in TEST_ENV to print the window's layer tree to wine.log.
DESCRIPTION="Full SC6 profile: MetalFX, native fullscreen, BGR10A2, Game Mode"
LAUNCH=bundle
RETINA_SC6=n
GAMEMODE=on
TEST_ENV=()
